Actually wait — for a genuine TDD check of thread 3, I can verify the new test catches the regression by temporarily removing the line... That's optional verification, not a permanent code change. I can do a quick sanity check locally (mutate, run test, see red, restore). That's good practice — prove the test actually covers the path.

